it's the potential

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:17.560
for the electrification of
our world that is happening.

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:22.200
That's how much electricity
will play a role, but most of it

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:26.790
is useless unless you can store
